"modules to receive more detailed information."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie boom aansig vertoon alle beskikbaar kontrole modules. Kliek op een van "
"die modules na ontvang meer gedetaileerde informasie."

#: proxywidget.cpp:54
msgid "The currently loaded configuration module."
msgstr "Die huidiglik gelaai opstelling module."

#: proxywidget.cpp:88
msgid ""
"<b>Changes in this module require root access.</b><br>"
"Click the \"Administrator Mode\" button to allow modifications in this module."
msgstr ""
"<b>Verander in hierdie module vereis root toegang verkry.</b><br>"
"Kliek die \"Administrateur Modus\" knoppie na toelaat veranderinge in hierdie "
"module."

#: proxywidget.cpp:92
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"This module requires special permissions, probably for system-wide "
"modifications; therefore, it is required that you provide the root password to "
"be able to change the module's properties.  If you do not provide the password, "
"the module will be disabled."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie module benodig spesiaal regte, waarskynlik vir system-wide "
"veranderinge. Daarom dit is benodig wat jy verskaf die root wagwoord na wees in "
"staat na verander die modules eienskappe. as lang as jy moet nie verskaf die "
"wagwoord, die module sal wees gestremde."

